"  {network}  - The name of this IRC network.\n"
"  {nick}     - Your current nickname.\n"
"  {regdate}  - The YYYY-MM-DD date at which your nick was registered.\n"
"  {regepoch} - The UNIX time at which your nick was registered.\n"
"\n"
"The %sCLEAR command removes all offered vhosts.\n"
"\n"
"The %sDEL command removes an offered vhost.\n"
"\n"
"The %sLIST command displays the offered vhosts, or optionally only those offered vhosts which match the given mask.\n"
